## OpenCode

Build and plan carry a small documentation/KB tool set. Route domain work to the
matching agent: `research`, `browser`, `creative`, `desktop`, `cloud`, `workspace`,
`math`, or `repository`. These specialists inherit the active model. Inspect
`~/.config/opencode/opencode.json` for their MCP namespaces and additional
`mcp-*` specialists. Switch agents or delegate a bounded task when its tools are
needed. The `review` agent is read-only and cannot delegate.
